Fulton is a hunter out of the film made by the [[Org/Bisney and Dixar/Arcane Intelligence|arcane intelligence]], one of three villains chosen to recover the stolen mirror. He is broad and handsome, and he boasts of kills he did not make. He came out of the film through the [[Phenomena/Enchanted Mirror|enchanted mirror]] with the others, and walks the real world.
